## Asset provenance

Every icon, font, sound, cursor, wallpaper, and illustration has a source and
license row in
[docs/design/asset-manifest.json](docs/design/asset-manifest.json). The
manifest is checked by `make check-assets`; an unlisted file under `assets/`
fails the gate. No sound file and no standalone illustration ships yet; both
categories stay explicit so the first new asset must add provenance in the same
change. Runtime-fetched wallpapers are user data and are never package
artifacts.

