| Package abstraction | PackageKit | GPL-2.0-or-later | separate process (D-Bus) |
| Sandboxed apps | Flatpak | LGPL-2.1-or-later | CLI/portal |
| Optional snap runtime | snapd | GPL-3.0-or-later | CLI/portal |
| Printing | CUPS | Apache-2.0 | IPP/D-Bus |
