The display managers are supported session entries, not package dependencies;
the desktop ships `dragonfruit.desktop` and degrades to the greeter when the
host display manager is ambiguous (ADR 0173). The per-service absence path and
the exact distro package names are recorded in
[packaging/optional-services.json](packaging/optional-services.json) and
[docs/design/interface-naming-and-licensing.md](docs/design/interface-naming-and-licensing.md#4-third-party-equivalents).

